| 1 | 0 | used-prune | `[0, -1, -1]` |
| 1 | 1 | assign | `[0, 1, -1]` |
| 2 | 0 | used-prune | `[0, 1, -1]` |
| 2 | 1 | used-prune | `[0, 1, -1]` |
| 2 | 2 | assign | `[0, 1, 2]` |
| 3 | -1 | success | `[0, 1, 2]` |
Path into triangle found true; nonedges are unconstrained.
